OL,3,GNEWSATeens remain in custody over
OL,4,Acounter-terror probe
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo teenagers have appeared in court
OL,7,Fafter police launched a counter-terror
OL,8,Finvestigation.
OL,10,FHarley Elliot and McKenzie Smyth, both
OL,11,Faged 19, appeared in the dock at
OL,12,FManchester Magistrates' Court for a
OL,13,Fbrief hearing where both were remanded
OL,14,Finto custody for a further seven days.
OL,16,FBoth are charged with possession of
OL,17,Foffensive weapons in a public place, a
OL,18,Fhammer and a kitchen knife, and having
OL,19,Fan article with intent to damage or
OL,20,Fdestroy property, detailed in the
OL,21,Fcharge sheet as spray paint and lighter
OL,22,Ffuel.
OL,23,APub: 14-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
