OL,3,GNEWSATeens remain in custody over
OL,4,Acounter-terror probe
OL,5,
OL,6,FBoth men were arrested in a Jewish
OL,7,Fneighbourhood of Salford in the early
OL,8,Fhours of 6 September after police
OL,9,Freceived reports of two men acting
OL,10,Fsuspiciously.
